lsd:Entity_32608 a lsd:Context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "Sacrifice was a professional wrestling pay_per_view (PPV) event produced by Total Nonstop Action Wrestling (TNA) promotion, which took place on 2011 at the Impact Wrestling Zone in Orlando. It was the seventh Sacrifice event. Sacrifice featured nine professional wrestling matches that involved different wrestlers from pre_existing scripted feuds and storylines." .

