lsd:Entity_56853 a lsd:Context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "Victory Road was a professional wrestling pay_per_view event produced by Total Nonstop Action Wrestling (TNA) promotion, which took place on 2011 at the Impact Zone in Orlando. It was the seventh event under the Victory Road chronology and the third event of the 2011 TNA PPV schedule. Victory Road featured eight professional wrestling matches that involved different wrestlers from pre_existing scripted feuds and storylines. The Wrestling Observer Newsletter listed Victory Road as the worst major wrestling show of 2011." .

