lsd:Entity_7356 a lsd:Context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 2010 Fed Cup (also known as the 2010 Fed Cup by BNP Paribas for sponsorship purposes) was the 48th edition of the tournament between national teams in women's tennis. The final took place at the San Diego Sports Arena in San Diego, United States, on 6 November–07 November 2010. The World Group II was the second highest level of Fed Cup competition in 2010." .

