    rdfs:label "WWE Insurrextion was an annual professional wrestling pay_per_view (PPV) event that ran from 2000 to 2003. WWE Insurrextion was also aired on Viewers Choice pay_per_view in Canada as well, only the 2002 event was aired in the United States as part of WWE Fanatic Series, a pay_per_view \"best of\" program." .

