lsd:Entity_10117 a lsd:Context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "Triplemanía VII was the seventh Triplemanía professional wrestling show promoted by AAA. The show took place on 11 June 1999, in Ciudad Madero, Mexico. The following year Peña and AAA held their first Triplemanía event, building it into an annual event that would become AAA's Super Bowl event, similar to the WWE's WrestleMania being the biggest show of the year. The Triplemanía VII show featured six professional wrestling matches with different wrestlers involved in pre_existing scripted feuds, plots and storylines." .

