    rdfs:label "Miss Philippines Earth 2012 was the 12th edition of the Miss Earth Philippines pageant. It was held on 2012 at the SM Mall of Asia in Pasay City, Philippines. Stefanowitz represented the Philippines at the Miss Earth 2012 pageant and placed Miss Earth Air 2012. Miss Earth Philippines is a beauty pageant in the Philippines where the participants and winners work on the environmental_social_humanitarian advocacy of the pageant. Mary Candice Ramos was crowned Miss Philippines Eco Tourism 2012, Thoreen Halvorsen won Miss Philippines Fire 2012, Glennifer Perido bagged Miss Philippines Air 2012, and Samantha Purvor was crowned Miss Philippines Water 2012. Mary Candice Ramos was crowned Miss Philippines Eco Tourism 2012, Thoreen Halvorsen won Miss Philippines Fire 2012, Glennifer Perido bagged Miss Philippines Air 2012, and Samantha Purvor was crowned Miss Philippines Water 2012." .

