lsd:Entity_28284 a lsd:Context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The year 1998 in Pancrase is the sixth year in the history of Pancrase, a mixed martial arts promotion based in Japan. Pancrase: Advance 1 was an event held on 1998, at Korakuen Hall in Tokyo, Japan. Pancrase: Advance 2 was an event held on 1998, at the Yokohama Cultural Gymnasium in Yokohama, Kanagawa, Japan. Pancrase: Advance 3 was an event held on 1998, at the Kobe Fashion Mart in Kobe, Hyogo, Japan. Pancrase: Advance 4 was an event held on 1998, at Korakuen Hall in Tokyo, Japan. Pancrase: Advance 5 was an event held on 1998, at the Yokohama Cultural Gymnasium in Yokohama, Kanagawa, Japan. Pancrase: Advance 6 was an event held on 1998, at Korakuen Hall in Tokyo, Japan. Pancrase: Advance 7 was an event held on 1998, at Korakuen Hall in Tokyo, Japan. Pancrase: Advance 8 was an event held on 1998, at the Kobe Fashion Mart in Kobe, Hyogo, Japan. Pancrase: 1998 in Pancrase Neo_Blood Tournament Opening Round was an event held on 1998, at Korakuen Hall in Tokyo, Japan. Pancrase: 1998 in Pancrase Neo_Blood Tournament Second Round was an event held on 1998, at the Aomori Prefectural Gymnasium in Aomori, Japan. Pancrase: 1998 in Pancrase Anniversary Show was an event held on 1998, at the Japanese Martial Arts Building in Tokyo, Japan. Pancrase: Advance 9 was an event held on 1998, at Korakuen Hall in Tokyo, Japan. Pancrase: Advance 10 was an event held on 1998, at Korakuen Hall in Tokyo, Japan. Pancrase: Advance 11 was an event held on 1998, at Umeda Stella Hall in Osaka, Osaka, Japan. Pancrase: Advance 12 was an event held on 1998, at the Tokyo Bay NK Hall in Urayasu, Chiba, Japan." .

