lsd:Entity_30783 a lsd:Context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 2008 season for 2008 Atlético Nacional season will feature them in the Copa Libertadores since last season (2007) they won the Copa Mustang twice in a row, making them the first team to reach this goal since the new format. After winning the 2007 Copa Mustang 2008 Atlético Nacional season earned a spot in the 2008 Copa Libertadores. 2008 Atlético Nacional season Became the first team in Colombia to earn two consecutive titles of the new Copa Mustang Format; both of them being in the same year 2007. At the beginning of the 2008_II Copa Mustang 2008 Atlético Nacional season was not as successful as it was thought they were going to be; starting by the fact of adding new player to the squad at the top of the league. 2008 Atlético Nacional season would have much trouble looking for a place in the top 8 during the first half of the 2008_II tournament. 2008 Atlético Nacional season on its closing game against La Equidad in the quadrangular phase struggled in the game by losing 4 _ 1; only about 10,000 fans showed up to the game to see them lose on their 2008 season final game. 2008 Atlético Nacional season made a good appearance in the 2008 Copa Libertadores representing Colombia. In the second round they had to play against Fluminense, in the first game they lost down by a goal, leaving the score 1_2 for Fluminense, later in the next game they had to go to Rio de Janeiro to play their last appearance in the 2008 Copa Libertadores, in this game they lost 1_0 letting Fluminense advance to the next round, and leaving 2008 Atlético Nacional season out from the tournament." .

