lsd:Entity_3766 a lsd:Context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The English Open was a table tennis tournament in England, last staged by the International Table Tennis Federation (ITTF) in Sheffield in 2011. The tournament was first held as the English Open in 1927 by the English Table Tennis Association. The tournament went on to feature in the ITTF Pro Tour five more times, in 1997, 1999, 2001, 2009 and in 2011, when it was held for the last time. The ITTF Pro Tour included the English Open in its schedule on six occasions from 1996 to 2011." .

