    rdfs:label "The Netherlands participated in the Netherlands in the Eurovision Song Contest 2017 with the song \"Lights and Shadows\" written by Rory de Kievit and Rick Vol. The song is performed by the Dutch three_piece girl group O'G3NE, who were internally selected by the Dutch broadcaster AVROTROS to represent the Netherlands at the 2017 contest in Kyiv, Ukraine. Prior to the 2017 contest, the Netherlands had participated in the Eurovision Song Contest fifty_seven times since their début as one of seven countries to take part in the inaugural contest in 1956. After months of rumours, AVROTROS announced that girl group O'G3NE would represent the Netherlands at the 2017 Eurovision Song Contest on 29 October 2016. The Netherlands was placed into the second semi_final, to be held on 2017, and was scheduled to perform in the first half of the show." .

