    rdfs:label "The Netherlands were present at the Netherlands in the Eurovision Song Contest 2009 in Moscow, sending their 50th entry. Anouk was selected by the poll, and she has also stated that she would represent the Netherlands in 2009, but would prefer not to participate in a national final. On 11 November 2008, it was confirmed that Jeroen van der Boom will take Gerard Joling's place in the group, and that De Toppers will still represent the Netherlands in the 2009 contest. The song that De Toppers represented the Netherlands with was selected through a national final titled Nationaal Songfestival 2009. Since the Netherlands was not one of the \"Big Four\" nor the host of the 2009 contest, The Toppers had to compete in one of the two semi_finals." .

