lsd:Entity_11722 a lsd:Context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The riot of Hoyerswerda Riots were xenophobic riots that lasted from 17 to 23 01 September 1991 in riot of Hoyerswerda, a town in the north_east of Saxony, Germany. In 1991, the word ausländerfrei (free of foreigners) became a synonym for the riot and Un_word of the year in Germany 1991." .

