lsd:Entity_12403 a lsd:Context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 2010 Russian Professional Rugby League season was the sixth edition of Russia's newly formatted top_flight rugby union competition, the Russian Rugby Championship (\"Russian Rugby Championship\"). The 2010 Russian Rugby Championship season has seen a transition to a traditional one league round_robin format with 8 teams taking place between May and 2010. The 2010 edition of the Russian Rugby Championship saw the dropping of the first phase of the season, which split the league into East and West sections and saw the involvement of several amateur teams." .

