lsd:Entity_13805 a lsd:Context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "1985 Tuvaluan general election were held in Tuvalu on 12 September 1985. The general election was held on 12 September 1985, with nine members re_elected to the Parliament of Tuvalu or Palamene o Tuvalu, including Prime Minister Tomasi Puapua and Finance Minister Henry Naisali." .

lsd:Entity_13808 a lsd:Context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The Soviet occupation of Latvia in 1940 refers to the military occupation of the Republic of Latvia by the Soviet Union under the provisions of the 1939 Molotov–Ribbentrop Pact with Nazi Germany and its Secret Additional Protocol signed in August 1939. On August 22, 1996, the Latvian parliament adopted a declaration which stated that the Soviet occupation of Latvia in 1940 was a military occupation and an illegal incorporation. In spring 1940, 51,000 left Latvia for resettlement in Poland. Four months before the arrival of Soviet troops in Latvia, Vilhelms Munters, addressing an audience at the University of Latvia on 1940, stated, \"We have every reason to describe the relations existing between Latvia and the Soviet Union as very satisfactory. On 1940, all three Baltic parliaments passed initial resolutions on the nationalization of land, followed in Latvia by a Bill of Land Reform a week later. According to the European Court of Human Rights, the Government of Latvia, the United States, and the European Union, the occupation of Latvia by the USSR in 1940, and its subsequent re_incorporation in the Soviet Union in 1944, was illegal. According to this account, the lawful government of Latvia was overthrown in 1940 and Soviet rule was imposed by force. As reported by Time in 1940, those who had failed to have their passports stamped for voting Latvia into the USSR were allowed to be shot in the back of the head by Soviet NKVD, The country remained occupied by the Soviet Union until restoration of its independence in 1991." .

lsd:Entity_13832 a lsd:Context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 1954 Oregon gubernatorial election took place on 02 November 1956, 1954." .

lsd:Entity_13843 a lsd:Context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 2017 Barcelona Open Banc Sabadell (also known as the Torneo Godó) was a men's tennis tournament played on outdoor clay courts. It was the 65th edition of Barcelona Open and part of the ATP World Tour 500 series of the 2017 ATP World Tour. It took place at the Real Club de Tenis Barcelona in Barcelona, Catalonia, Spain, from 24 April 2017 through 30 April 2017." .

lsd:Entity_13865 a lsd:Context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "2007 Empress's Cup Final was the 29th final of the Empress's Cup competition. The final was played at Japan National Stadium in Tokyo on January 1, 2008. Nippon TV Beleza won their 8th title, by defeating defending champion Tasaki Perule FC – with Homare Sawa and Eriko Arakawa goal." .

lsd:Entity_1387 a lsd:Context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 2015 Supercopa Euroamericana was the first edition of Supercopa Euroamericana, a men's association football friendly tournament created by DirecTV, disputed between the Copa Sudamericana and the UEFA Europa League winners. The match was played in 2015 by Club Atlético River Plate, the 2014 Copa Sudamericana champions, and Sevilla, the 2013–14 UEFA Europa League champions. Club Atlético River Plate won the match 1–0." .

