lsd:Entity_15107 a lsd:Context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "In 2013, the 2013 Campeonato Brasileiro Série D, the fourth division of the Brazilian League, will be contested for the fifth time in history. The 40 teams are divided in eight groups of 5, playing within them in a double round_robin format. However, teams who were not promoted will have to re_qualify for 2014 Campeonato Brasileiro Série D through their respective state leagues.The competition can also be considered as 4 mini_tournaments (Group 1+2;3+4;5+6;7+8) because according to the playoff_structure, exactly one team of each \"mini_tournament\" will be promoted." .

