    rdfs:label "Miss Canada 1981 is a beauty pageant for young women in Canada. According to the new Miss Canada 1981 and Miss Teen Canada web site, the title was re_established with a focus on personality over physical appearance. The Miss Canada 1981 competition is Canada's oldest extant beauty pageant. Dominique Dufour, the winner of the Miss Canada 1981 Pageant in 1981, co_hosted with Perry from 1982 until 1990. Miss Canada 1982, Karen Baldwin, is the only Miss Canada 1981 to also win Miss Universe." .

