lsd:Entity_15981 a lsd:Context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "This is a record of the results of the Chile national football team at the Chile at the FIFA World Cup. The Chile at the FIFA World Cup, sometimes called the Football World Cup or the Soccer World Cup, but usually referred to simply as the World Cup, is an international association football competition contested by the men's national teams of the members of Fédération Internationale de Football Association (FIFA), the sport's global governing body. Chile have appeared in nine Chile at the FIFA World Cup finals to date, which were in 1930, 1950, 1962 (which they hosted), 1966, 1974, 1982, 1998, 2010 and 2014." .

lsd:Entity_1599 a lsd:Context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 2015 Thai Premier League (also known as Toyota Thai Premier League due to the sponsorship from Toyota) was the 19th season of the Thai Premier League since its establishment in 1996. Buriram United F.C. were the defending champions, having won their Thai Premier League title the 2014 Thai Premier League. A total of 18 teams contested the league, including 15 sides from the 2014 Thai Premier League and three promoted from the 2014 Thai Division 1 League. Police United, PTT Rayong, Songkhla United, Air Force Central and GSE Samut Songkhram were relegated to the 2015 Thai Division 1 League after finishing the 2014 Thai Premier League." .

