lsd:Entity_16004 a lsd:Context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "Operation Eternal Light, MeK's codename), was the last major military operation of the Iran–Iraq War, conducted by and ending in a decisive victory for Iran. Led by Lieutenant_General Ali Sayad Shirazi, Operation Mersad began on 26 July 1988 and lasted only a few days, whereby the Iranian Armed Forces crushed the MEK in what was the last military operation of any major significance during the war. On 26 July 1988, the MEK, with the support of the Iraqi military, started Operation Forough Javidan (Eternal Light) in central Iran. Operation Mersad was the last land battle of the Iran–Iraq War." .

lsd:Entity_16011 a lsd:Context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 1965 Rand Grand Prix was a motor race, run to Formula One_style rules, held on 04 December 1965 at Kyalami, South Africa. The race was run over 50 laps of the circuit, and was won by Australian driver Jack Brabham in a Brabham BT11." .

lsd:Entity_16014 a lsd:Context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The Battle of Hightower (also called Battle of Etowah Cliffs) in 1793 was part of the Chickamauga Wars, in which the Cherokee sought to defend tribal territory from increasing settlement by the citizens of the new United States." .

lsd:Entity_16039 a lsd:Context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The year 2014 is the 3rd year in the history of the Glory, an international kickboxing event. 2014 starts with Glory 14: Zagreb, and ends with Glory 18: Oklahoma. Glory 14: Zagreb was a kickboxing event held on March 8, 2014 at the Arena Zagreb in Zagreb, Croatia. Glory 15: Istanbul was a kickboxing event held on April 12, 2014 at the Ülker Sports Arena in Istanbul, Turkey. Glory 16: Denver was a kickboxing event held on May 3, 2014 at the 1stBank Center in Broomfield, Colorado, USA. Glory 17: Los Angeles was a kickboxing event held on June 21, 2014 at The Forum in Inglewood, California, USA. Glory 18: Oklahoma was a kickboxing event, held on November 7, 2014 at the Grand Casino Hotel Resort in Shawnee, Oklahoma, USA." .

