lsd:Entity_16112 a lsd:Context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "Lisfe is an annual short film festival held in the city of Leiden, The Netherlands. Lisfe (previously known as Leiden International Short Film Experience, LISFE) was founded in 2009 as a cineclub and has grown to become one of the Netherland's largest international short film festivals. Lisfe started off in 2009 as a spin_off of the University of Leiden Student Cinema Club. Next to the main festival in spring, Lisfe is involved in cultural events throughout the year in collaboration with several organizations in Leiden and surroundings." .

