lsd:Entity_17157 a lsd:Context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "Move to the Beat is the name of Coca_Cola's promotional campaign for the 2012 Summer Olympics in London. Sponsored by Coca_Cola, Move to the Beat draws inspiration from the music of London and hopes to connect young people, predominantly teenagers, to the Olympic Games. Five athletes, chosen for embodying \"values of positivity and optimism that are at the heart of Coca_Cola and the Olympic movement\", will act as ambassadors of the Move to the Beat campaign." .

