lsd:Entity_1765 a lsd:Context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "Operation Prairie II was a U.S. military operation in Quảng Trị Province, South Vietnam that sought to eliminate People's Army of Vietnam (PAVN) forces south of the Vietnamese Demilitarized Zone (DMZ) that took place from 1 February to 18 March 1967. Operation Prairie II concluded on 18 March 1967, the Marines had lost 93 killed, 483 wounded and claiming 694 PAVN killed and 20 captured 137 individual weapons were recovered during the campaign." .

lsd:Entity_17658 a lsd:Context_narration ;
