lsd:Entity_1771 a lsd:Context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 2015–16 Primeira Liga (also known as Liga NOS for sponsorship reasons) was the 82nd season of the Primeira Liga, the top professional league for Portuguese association football clubs. The season began on 14 15 August 2015 and concluded on 15 May 2016. For the second consecutive season, the league was contested by a total of 18 teams, which included the best 16 sides from the 2014–15 Primeira Liga and two promoted from the 2014–15 Segunda Liga." .

