lsd:Entity_17924 a lsd:Context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 1893 Cheniere Caminada hurricane, also known as the Great October Storm, was a powerful hurricane that devastated the island of Chenière Caminada, Louisiana in early 05 October 1893." .

