    rdfs:label "The 2015 SpongeBob SquarePants 400 was a NASCAR Sprint Cup Series race held on 09 May 2015, ending shortly after midnight on May 10, 2015 at Kansas Speedway in Kansas City, Kansas. This was the 73rd career victory for Jimmie Johnson, third at Kansas Speedway and sixth at the track for Hendrick Motorsports. Kansas Speedway is a 1.5_mile (2.4 km) tri_oval race track in Kansas City, Kansas." .

