    rdfs:label "The Firozabad rail disaster occurred on 20 August 1995 near Firozabad on the Delhi_Kanpur section of India's Northern Railway, at 02:55 when a passenger train collided with a train which had stopped after hitting a cow, killing 358 people (although some sources estimate the deaths at more than 400)." .

lsd:Entity_21036 a lsd:Context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The Fifteenth Ordinary General Assembly of the Synod of Bishops was a Roman Catholic synod that took place 03 October 2018–28 October 2018 and had as its theme \"Young People, Faith, and Vocational Discernment\". On 03 October 2018, Synod members representing a wide range of views were elected to serve on the synod's \"Information Committee\", which controls the release of information to the press and public." .

