lsd:Entity_24173 a lsd:Context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The year Pride The Best Vol.1 is the 6th year in the history of the Pride Fighting Championships, a mixed martial arts promotion based in Japan. 1 was an event held on 22 February 2002 at the Korakuen Hall in Tokyo, Japan. Pride 19: Bad Blood was an event held on February 24, Pride The Best Vol.1 at the Saitama Super Arena in Saitama, Japan. Pride 20: Armed and Ready was an event held on April 28, Pride The Best Vol.1 at the Yokohama Arena in Yokohama, Japan. Pride 21: Demolition was an event held on June 23, Pride The Best Vol.1 at the Saitama Super Arena in Saitama, Japan. 2 was an event held on July 20, Pride The Best Vol.1 at the Differ Ariake Arena in Tokyo, Japan. Pride FC: Shockwave was an event held on August 28, Pride The Best Vol.1 at the Tokyo National Stadium in Tokyo, Japan. Pride 22: Beasts from the East 2 was an event held on September 29, Pride The Best Vol.1 at the Nagoya Rainbow Hall in Nagoya, Japan. 3 was an event held on October 20, Pride The Best Vol.1 at the Differ Ariake Arena in Tokyo, Japan. Pride 23: Championship Chaos 2 was an event held on November 24, Pride The Best Vol.1 at the Tokyo Dome in Tokyo, Japan. Pride 24: Cold Fury 3 was an event held on 23 December 2002 at the Marine Messe Fukuoka in Fukuoka, Japan." .

