    rdfs:label "The 2018–19 Indian cricket season was the 126th cricket season since the commencement of first_class cricket in India. The new T20 Challenger Trophy started the domestic season in August.India Blue Women defeated India Red women by 4 runs to win the inaugural trophy. In February and March 2019, South Africa Under_19 cricket team toured India to play 2_match Youth Test series against India Under_19 cricket team. India Green Under_23 Women defeated India Blue Under_23 Women by 8 wickets to win the tournament. Women's U23 T20 Challenger Trophy was played from 4 to 8 October 2018 at Mysuru. India Green Under_23 Women defeated India Blue Under_23 Women by 8 wickets in the final to win the tournament." .

