lsd:Entity_29833 a lsd:Context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The Chilean War of Independence was a war between pro_independence Chile Criollo peoples seeking political and economic independence from Spain and royalist creoles supporting continued allegiance to the Captaincy General of Chile and membership of the Spanish Empire. The Chilean War of Independence was part of the more aroused Spanish American wars of independence. The independence wars in Chile (1810–1818) and Peru (1809–1824) had a negative impact on the Chile wheat industry." .

lsd:Entity_2984 a lsd:Context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 2007 Island Games were the 12th edition of the Island Games, and were held in Rhodes, Greece, from 30 June 2007 to 06 July 2007." .

lsd:Entity_29851 a lsd:Context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 2010–11 Olympiacos F.C. season was Olympiacos F.C.' 52nd consecutive season in the Super League Greece. Olympiacos F.C. finished first in the Greek Super League, winning the title after an unsuccessful 2009–10 Olympiacos F.C. season." .

lsd:Entity_29854 a lsd:Context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 2011 Green Soccer Bowl (reported by some media outlets as the Obama Cup) was a proposed association football tournament." .

