lsd:Entity_30418 a lsd:Context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 2015–16 NBA season was the 70th season of the National Basketball Association. The regular season began on Tuesday, 27 October 2015 at the United Center, home of the Chicago Bulls, with their game against the Cleveland Cavaliers. The regular season began on Tuesday, 27 October 2015 at the United Center, home of the Chicago Bulls, who hosted a game against the Cleveland Cavaliers at 8:00 p.m. EDT, then the Atlanta Hawks hosted the Detroit Pistons at 8:00 p.m. EDT." .

lsd:Entity_30438 a lsd:Context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "Since 2008 the festival takes place in the capital of Cyclades, Ermoupolis of Syros, and includes animation movies screenings, special tributes to international festivals, professional forum with the participation of distinguished Greek and foreign creators and professionals, workshops for students and children, the applied follow_up workshop “making of”, parties and other parallel events. Animasyros is the largest animation festival in Greece and one of the 20 largest of its kind in Europe. In 2014 Animasyros joined, after a decision taken by Syros_ Ermoupolis’ City Council, the task group that will create and establish the proposal of the nomination “Syros_ Cyclades 2021” _ Cultural Capital of Europe. Animasyros is set every year under the auspices of the Municipality of Syros_ Ermoupolis, the South Aegean Region, whereas receives the active support of both public, such as the General Secretariat for Gender Equality, the Ministry of Tourism, the University of Aegean, and private institutions, such as Onassis Cultural Centre, the Benaki Museum etc. Animasyros became part of this group and now works towards drafting and promoting the nomination, recognizing the uniqueness of Ermoupolis as well as of the whole archipelago as an integral monument of European cultural reference. At the same time, Animasyros strongly supports every initiative taken by the Municipality in its effort to get the historic site of Ermoupolis and the medieval settlement of Ano Syros included in the Unesco World Heritage List as the 18th Greek monument." .

lsd:Entity_30455 a lsd:Context_narration ;
