    rdfs:label "The Open International de Squash de Nantes is an annual international squash tournament for professional players, held in Nantes in France in September. The very first edition of the « Open International de squash de Nantes » was held at Le Lieu Unique in 2015. From 2016, the « Open International de squash de Nantes » included for the first time a female competition. In 2019, the name of the competition grows « Open de France » to include the most important tournaments of the Professional Squash Association. This event links culture and sport by staging squash through a glass court located in an emblematic place of Nantes and by invited artists around Nantes' culture." .

