lsd:Entity_33150 a lsd:Context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 2001 El Salvador earthquake struck El Salvador on 13 January 2001 at 17:33:34 UTC. The 13 January 2001 earthquake was a result of normal faulting within the subducting Cocos Plate as shown by the hypocentral depth and published focal mechanisms. Describing the 13 January 2001 earthquake as a 'natural disaster' is not only irresponsible, but also a declaration of future impotence." .

lsd:Entity_33166 a lsd:Context_narration ;
