lsd:Entity_3387 a lsd:Context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 2016 DFL_Supercup was the seventh edition of the German Super Cup under the name DFL_Supercup, an annual football match contested by the winners of the previous season's Bundesliga and DFB_Pokal competitions. The match was played on 2016 at the Westfalenstadion in Dortmund. It featured FC Bayern Munich, the winners of the 2015–16 Bundesliga (and the 2015–16 DFB_Pokal), who had lost the three previous super cups and last won in 2012, and 2015–16 Bundesliga runners_up Borussia Dortmund, who last won in 2014. FC Bayern Munich won the DFL_Supercup 2–0 for their fifth title." .

