lsd:Entity_38020 a lsd:Context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "United Nations Security Council Resolution 1429, adopted unanimously on 30 July 2002, after recalling all previous resolutions on the situation in Western Sahara, particularly resolutions 1359 (2001) and 1394 (2001), the Council extended the mandate of the United Nations Mission for the Referendum in Western Sahara (MINURSO) for six months until 31 January 2003." .

lsd:Entity_38038 a lsd:Context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The bobsleigh at the 1948 Winter Olympics – two_man bobsleigh at the 1948 Winter Olympics in St. Moritz." .

