lsd:Entity_38609 a lsd:Context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The Charge of the Savoia Cavalleria at Isbuscenskij was a clash between the Italian cavalry Regiment \"Savoia Cavalleria\" (3rd) and the Soviet Union 812th Siberian Infantry Regiment (304th Rifle Division), that took place on 24 August 1942, near the hamlet (khutor) of Izbushensky (Избушенский), close to the junction between the Don and Khopyor rivers." .

