lsd:Entity_38904 a lsd:Context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 2016 Kelantan FA season was Kelantan FA's 8th season in the Malaysia Super League since being promoted and 21st successive season in the top flight of Malaysian football league system. They were also eligible to compete in Malaysia FA Cup starting from the second round and Malaysia Cup after placed in 6th place at the end of 2016 Malaysia Super League first leg. The 2016 Kelantan FA season began on 13 February and concluded on 2016. The 2016 Malaysia Cup draw was made on 2016 in Kuala Lumpur." .

lsd:Entity_38907 a lsd:Context_narration ;
