    rdfs:label "The 1925 Cork Senior Hurling Championship was the 37th staging of the Cork Senior Hurling Championship since its establishment by the Cork County Board in 1887. The championship began on 05 April 1925 and ended on 1925." .

lsd:Entity_4383 a lsd:Context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 1991 Monte Carlo Open was a men's tennis tournament played on clay court. It was the 85th edition of the Monte_Carlo Masters, and was part of the ATP Super 9 of the 1991 ATP Tour. It took place at the Monte Carlo Country Club in Roquebrune_Cap_Martin, France, near Monte Carlo, Monaco, from 22 April through 1991." .

