lsd:Entity_61827 a lsd:Context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "Incubate was an annual multidisciplinary arts festival held every September in Tilburg, Netherlands from 2005 to 2016. In 2005 ZXZW started as a two_day underground punk, hardcore and electronic music festival with 47 artists. Three editions of Incubate were held in 2016, but in February 2017 the festival's organizing foundation announced that the grants from Tilburg and Noord_Brabant were withdrawn, and no festival was held in 2017. Incubate was a two_day music event with a pre_party in 2005, and by 2009 became a multidisciplinary art festival lasting more than a week. The eleventh edition of Incubate was held from Monday, September 14 to Sunday, September 20 in Tilburg. Incubate took place in the inner city of Tilburg at the following venues: Bibliotheek Tilburg Centrum, BKKC, Boerderij 't Schop, Café De Plaats, Cul de Sac, De Beukentuin, De NWE Vorst, Dolfijn Bowling, Duvelhok, Extase, Factorium, Filmfoyer, Galerie Kokon, Hall of Fame, Kafee 't Buitenbeentje, Koepelhal, Koningsplein, Kraakpand / Squat, Kunstpodium T, Little Devil, Mayor's Room, Muzentuin, NS16, Open Air Stage, Paradox, Pauluskerk, Pieter Vreedeplein, Project Space Tilburg _ Gust van Dijk, 013, Sounds, Studio, Synagoge, Theaters Tilburg, V39, Virginarty, Weemoed, Willemsplein, Zaal 16." .

