lsd:Entity_9919 a lsd:Context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 2016–17 Saudi Professional League (also known as the Jameel League for sponsorship reasons) was the 41st season of Saudi Professional League, the top Saudi professional league for association football clubs, since its inception in 1976. The season started on 11 12 August 2016 and concluded on 04 May 2017. The league comprises 14 teams, 11 from the 2015–16 Saudi Professional League, as well as two teams promoted from the 2015–16 First Division and the 2015–16 Saudi Professional League winners." .

lsd:Entity_9923 a lsd:Context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 2011 South Korean Figure Skating Championships (Korean: 제65회 전국 남녀 피겨스케이팅 종합선수권대회) were the South Korean Figure Skating Championships for the 2010_11 season. The competition was held between 14 January 2011 and 16 January 2011 at the Taereung Ice Rink in Seoul." .

lsd:Entity_9925 a lsd:Context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The Total Package Tour was a co_headlining concert tour featuring American bands New Kids on the Block, Boyz II Men and American singer Paula Abdul." .

lsd:Entity_9939 a lsd:Context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 1872 North Cascades earthquake occurred at 9:40 p.m. local time on 14 December 1872 in central Washington state." .

lsd:Entity_9950 a lsd:Context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 2009 The Dominion Curling Club Championship was held November 25–29 at the St. George's Golf and Country Club in Etobicoke, Toronto, Ontario." .

lsd:Entity_9984 a lsd:Context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The Second Gulf of Sidra offensive was a military operation in the 2011 Libyan Civil War conducted by rebel anti_Gaddafi forces in August and September 2011 to take control of towns along the Gulf of Sidra in an effort to surround Muammar Gaddafi's hometown of Sirte, which was held by pro_Gaddafi forces. At the same time, eastern NLA forces captured the village of Harawa in an attempt to support forces from the west which were already engaged in a battle for Sirte itself." .

