    rdfs:label "The 2008 Six_red Snooker International (also known as the 2008 SangSom 6_red Snooker International for promotional and marketing purposes) was a six_red snooker tournament that took place between 08 July 2008 and 13 July 2008 at the Montien Riverside Hotel in Bangkok, Thailand." .

