lsd:Entity_17848 a lsd:Context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The Battle of Mallavelly (also spelled Malvilly or Malavalli) was fought on 27 March 1799 between forces of the British East India Company and the Kingdom of Mysore during the Fourth Anglo_Mysore War." .

lsd:Entity_17852 a lsd:Context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "Tudor Revival architecture (also known as mock Tudor in the UK) first manifested itself in domestic architecture in the United Kingdom in the latter half of the 19th century. Outside North America, Tudorbethan is also used synonymously with Tudor architecture Revival and mock Tudor." .

lsd:Entity_17884 a lsd:Context_narration ;
