lsd:Entity_38759 a lsd:Context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 2010–11 Toto Cup Al was the twenty_nine season of the third most important association football tournament in Israel since its introduction and seventh under the current format. On 19 January 2011, Hapoel Ironi Kiryat Shmona F.C. won the 2010–11 Toto Cup Al, a year after winning the Leumit version of the cup, it was their first Toto Cup Al title overall." .

lsd:Entity_38763 a lsd:Context_narration ;
