lsd:Entity_47959 a lsd:Context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "Islam is a minority religion in Finland. Nowadays, there are dozens of Islam communities in Islam in Finland, but only a minority of Muslims have joined them. In 1996 these groups came together to form a cooperative organ _ the Federation of Islam Organizations in Islam in Finland. There are dozens of independent Islam societies in Islam in Finland. The Islam Society of Islam in Finland was established in 1987." .

lsd:Entity_48014 a lsd:Context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 1996 Cork Intermediate Hurling Championship was the 87th staging of the Cork Intermediate Hurling Championship since its establishment by the Cork County Board in 1909. The championship began on 15 June 1996 and ended on 03 November 1996. On 03 November 1996, Newtownshandrum won the championship after a 0_12 to 0_09 defeat of Cloyne in a final replay at Páirc Uí Chaoimh." .

lsd:Entity_48022 a lsd:Context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "An unofficial Pitcairn Islands European Convention on Human Rights referendum, 2007 was held in the Pitcairn Islands on 18 July 2007." .

lsd:Entity_48035 a lsd:Context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 2014–15 Prva HNL (officially known as the 2014–15 Prva HNL for sponsorship reasons) was the 24th season of the Prva HNL, the national championship for men's association football teams in Croatia, since its establishment in 1992. The season started on 18 19 July 2014 and ended on 30 May 2015." .

