lsd:Entity_51805 a lsd:Context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The Ikea Effect is a cognitive bias in which consumers place a disproportionately high value on products they partially created. The researchers noted that their use of \"simple IKEA boxes and Lego sets that did not permit customization\" did not prevent participants from manifesting the Ikea Effect." .

lsd:Entity_5182 a lsd:Context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 2014–15 ISU Speed Skating World Cup, officially the Essent ISU World Cup Speed Skating 2014–2015, was a series of international speed skating competitions that ran the entire season. Additionally, skaters placed among the top 32 in the final 2013–14 ISU Speed Skating World Cup, or included in the final qualifying list (including the reserve list) of the 2014 Winter Olympics, for the distance category concerned, was allowed entry." .

lsd:Entity_51829 a lsd:Context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 2015 LINAFOOT was the inaugural season of the Chad Premier League, the top Chadian league for association football clubs. This edition of Chad Premier League was marked by many controversies, which led to proclaiming AS CotonTchad league champion, and then later giving Gazelle FC champion title back." .

lsd:Entity_51842 a lsd:Context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 1994 California State Treasurer election occurred on 08 November 1994. The Republican nominee, Board of Equalization Chairman Matt Fong, narrowly defeated the Democratic nominee, Phil Angelides, for the office previously held by incumbent Kathleen Brown, who chose not to seek re_election in favor of running for governor." .

