lsd:Entity_56942 a lsd:Context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 2008 Bavarian state election was held on 28 September 2008 to elect the members of the Landtag of Bavaria. Summary of the 28 September 2008 election results for the Landtag of Bavaria." .

lsd:Entity_56981 a lsd:Context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The 2004 Nazran raid was a large_scale raid carried out in the Republic of Ingushetia, Russia on the night of 21 June 2004–22, 2004, by a group of mostly Chechen and Ingush militants led by the Chechen commander Shamil Basayev. Several days after the 2004 Beslan school siege, Deputy Prosecutor General of Russia Vladimir Kolesnikov said 10 of the weapons stolen in Nazran were used in the Beslan attack." .

lsd:Entity_57022 a lsd:Context_narration ;
