lsd:Entity_60725 a lsd:Context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "The Rey de Reyes (Spanish for \"King of Kings\") was the ninth annual Rey de Reyes professional wrestling tournament and show, produced by the Mexican wrestling promotion AAA. The event took place on 11 March 2005 in the Convention Center in Ciudad Madero, Tamaulipas, Mexico. Starting in 1997 and every year since then the Mexican Lucha Libre, or professional wrestling, company AAA has held a Rey de Reyes (Spanish for \"King of Kings') show in the spring. As part of their annual Rey de Reyes event AAA holds the eponymious Rey de Reyes tournament to determine that specific year's Rey. The Rey de Reyes show featured six professional wrestling matches with different wrestlers involved in pre_existing, scripted feuds, plots, and storylines." .

