lsd:Entity_62578 a lsd:Context_narration ;
    rdfs:label "LEGO Harry Potter is a Lego theme based on the films of the Harry Potter series. The first sets appeared in 2001, to coincide with the release of the first film, Harry Potter and the Philosopher's Stone. Lego revived the Harry Potter theme after a three_year gap from previous set released in 2007." .

lsd:Entity_62580 a lsd:Context_narration ;
