    rdfs:label "Moldova participated in the Moldova in the Eurovision Song Contest 2014 in Copenhagen, Denmark. The Moldovan entry was selected through the national final O melodie pentru Europa 2014, organised by the Moldovan broadcaster TeleRadio_Moldova (TRM). O melodie pentru Europa 2014 was the national final format developed by TRM in order to select Moldova's entry for the Moldova in the Eurovision Song Contest 2014. During the semi_final allocation draw on 2014 at the Copenhagen City Hall, Moldova was drawn to compete in the second half of the first semi_final on 2014." .

